 you've seen on the cost side and the efficiency of the cost savings?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/27/boyd-gaming-corp-byd-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcr/"},{"c":"BYD 2021 Q4","e":"byd","d":"2022-02-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Keith Smith","x":"By streamlining our cost structure, enhancing our capabilities and focusing on our core customers, we have been able to consistently deliver exceptional results since reopening.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/03/boyd-gaming-byd-q4-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BYD 2022 Q1","e":"byd","d":"2022-04-26","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Keith Smith","x":"So there's always been somewhat of a symbiotic relationship between both Downtown and Locals properties and the Strip because we don't have as much pricing power if the Strip isn't full.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/04/26/boyd-gaming-byd-q1-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BYD 2025 Q2","e":"byd","d":"2025-07-24","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Chad Beynon","x":"I know it was about three months ago when the tariff announcements were announced, and there has been some volatility there.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/05/boyd-gaming-byd-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BYD 2025 Q2","e":"byd","d":"2025-07-24","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Josh Hirsberg","x":"I think, you know, if you look back at our remarks in the first quarter, we had done a lot of work around understanding what we could do to mitigate tariffs on the operating expense side, but also a capital expense side.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/05/boyd-gaming-byd-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BYD 2025 Q2","e":"byd","d":"2025-07-24","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Keith Smith","x":"For the quarter, revenues excluding tax pass-through amounts grew 4% while EBITDAR also increased 4% to $358 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/05/boyd-gaming-byd-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BYD 2025 Q2","e":"byd","d":"2025-07-24","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Josh Hirsberg","x":"The tax pass-through amount for our online segment was $134 million during the second quarter, compared to $104 million in the year-ago period.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/05/boyd-gaming-byd-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BYD 2025 Q3","e":"byd","d":"2025-10-23","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Josh Hirsberg","x":"Finally, beginning with this quarter's financial results, we have provided the tax pass-through amounts as a separate line item on our GAAP income statement.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/23/boyd-gaming-byd-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BYD 2025 Q3","e":"byd","d":"2025-10-23","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Josh Hirsberg","x":"Excluding the tax pass-through amount for this quarter, company-wide margins for the third quarter this year would have been five to ten basis points above the margin we reported.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/23/boyd-gaming-byd-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BYD 2025 Q3","e":"byd","d":"2025-10-23","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Keith E. Smith","x":"Given current trends, we are increasing our guidance for this segment to $60 million in EBITDAR for this year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/23/boyd-gaming-byd-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BYD 2026 Q2","e":"byd","d":"2026-07-23","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Keith E. Smith","x":"A company wide basis, revenues increased 3% and EBITDA grew 2% for the quarter, adjusting for the impact of last year's FanDuel transaction and the tax pass through amounts related to our market access agreement.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/07/23/boyd-gaming-byd-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BYD 2026 Q2","e":"byd","d":"2026-07-23","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Josh Hirsberg","x":"As a result of Boyd Interactive's strong performance, we are raising full year guidance for our online segment by $5 million to $35 million to $40 million full-year 2026.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/07/23/boyd-gaming-byd-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BYD 2026 Q2","e":"byd","d":"2026-07-23","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Josh Hirsberg","x":"And given the positive response to Sky River's recent expansion, we are raising our guidance by $3 million for our managed business to $113 million to $117 million for the full year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/07/23/boyd-gaming-byd-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BYD 2026 Q3","e":"byd","d":"2026-10-22","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Keith E. Smith","x":"These items include the permanent closure of Sam's Town Tunica in November 2025, sale of Sam's Town Shreveport on August 1st of this year, higher property taxes at Kansas Star, a reduction in the tax pass through amounts.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/22/boyd-gaming-byd-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[35,1,8381,0,0,0,6253,1725],[36,1,7919,0,0,0,6037,1477],[37,1,6964,0,0,0,5458,1153],[38,1,9201,0,0,0,6699,1942],[39,1,9702,0,0,0,6824,2372],[40,1,8597,0,0,0,6590,1616],[41,1,8103,0,0,0,5924,1780],[44,1,7973,0,0,0,5927,1637],[45,1,8066,0,0,0,5996,1658],[46,1,6014,0,0,0,4588,1110],[47,1,6683,0,0,0,5050,1210],[48,1,6921,0,0,0,5297,1216],[49,1,8083,0,0,0,6261,1411],[50,1,7295,0,0,0,5125,1678],[62,1,10148,0,0,0,9952,0],[63,1,8281,0,0,0,8012,0],[64,1,7240,0,0,0,5891,396],[65,1,7866,0,0,0,5443,1626],[66,1,6814,0,0,0,1927,4246],[67,1,10295,0,0,0,3205,6304]],"cinema":[[35,1,8381,0,0,0,6253,1725],[36,1,7919,0,0,0,6037,1477],[37,1,6964,0,0,0,5458,1153],[38,1,9201,0,0,0,6699,1942],[39